* ============================================================
* Device models — ZK-4KZ fan temperature controller
* All ICs are BEHAVIORAL stand-ins (no vendor models used).
* They capture the DC/static behavior the design relies on:
* regulation, dropout, output swing limits, offset, bias current.
* ============================================================

* ── Rectifier diode (fan flyback D1) ────────────────────────
.model D1N4007 D BV=1000 IS=1e-9 N=2 RS=0.05

* ── Clamp diode used inside the op-amp model ───────────────
.model DCLAMP D IS=1e-15 N=1

* ── LM317 adjustable regulator (U1) ─────────────────────────
* Pins: IN ADJ OUT
* - V(OUT) = V(ADJ) + 1.25 V, 50 mohm output resistance
* - dropout 1.7 V (datasheet: ~1.7 V @ 0.2 A)
* - ADJ pin current 50 uA flows OUT of the ADJ pin
* Voltage-output model (converges robustly); input current is not modeled,
* dissipation is computed as (V_in - V_out) * I_out in run_sim.py.
.subckt LM317B in adj out
I_adj in adj 50u
B_o o_int 0 V = max(0, min(V(adj)+1.25, V(in)-1.7))
R_o o_int out 0.05
.ends LM317B

* ── 78L05 fixed 5 V regulator (U3) ──────────────────────────
* Pins: IN GND OUT — 5.00 V, dropout 1.7 V, 3 mA quiescent, 0.1 ohm output
.subckt REG78L05 in gnd out
I_q in gnd 3m
B_o o_int gnd V = max(0, min(5.0, V(in,gnd)-1.7))
R_o o_int out 0.1
.ends REG78L05

* ── LM35 temperature sensor (U4) ────────────────────────────
* Pins: VS VOUT GND T   — T is a stimulus node whose voltage = temperature in °C
* 10 mV/°C, needs Vs >= 4 V (output scaled down below that), 60 uA quiescent
.subckt LM35B vs vout gnd t
I_q vs gnd 60u
B_o vo_int gnd V = V(t)*0.01 * min(1, max(V(vs,gnd),0)/4)
R_o vo_int vout 1
.ends LM35B

* ── LM358 op-amp, one section (U2A / U2B) ───────────────────
* Pins: INP INN VCC VEE OUT
* - DC gain 100 dB, GBW ~1 MHz
* - output swing: VEE+5 mV .. VCC-1.5 V (LM358 V_OH @ 5 V supply)
* - VOS: input offset (param), IB: input bias current (param, flows OUT of
*   the input pins — PNP input stage). IB pulls a floating input toward VCC.
.subckt LM358B inp inn vcc vee out params: VOS=0 IB=45n
B_ibp vcc inp I = IB*min(1, max(0, (V(vcc)-V(inp))/0.1))
B_ibn vcc inn I = IB*min(1, max(0, (V(vcc)-V(inn))/0.1))
I_q   vcc vee 350u
B_g   vee n1 I = 1e-3*(V(inp) + VOS - V(inn))
R_g   n1 vee 1e8
C_g   n1 vee 159p
* keep the integrator node from winding up far past the rails
E_hi  nhi vee vcc vee 1
E_lo  nlo vee vee vee 1
D_hi  n1 nhi DCLAMP
D_lo  nlo n1 DCLAMP
B_out o_int vee V = min(max(V(n1,vee), 0.005), V(vcc,vee)-1.5)
R_out o_int out 20
.ends LM358B

.end
